          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Bakery Gift Boxes, Baked From Scratch and Shipped Nationwide</h2><p>Sunflour Baking Company bakes everything in our Charlotte, NC kitchens from scratch, in small batches, every day. Our cookie gift boxes take the best of what comes out of those ovens and packages it into something worth shipping across the country.</p><p>Each box is a curated mix of our most popular cookies and treats, packaged to arrive looking and tasting like they just came out of the case. Because they did, just recently.</p><h3>Three Box Options, All Built to Impress</h3><p>The Ohhhh Zone is our crowd-pleaser: a mix of cookies and salted pretzels that covers sweet, salty, and everything between. The Zen Zone pairs cookies and a fudgy brownie for anyone who takes their dessert seriously. The Comfort Zone is straight cookies, no distractions, for the person who knows exactly what they want.</p><p>All three ship nationwide. All three arrive in bakery packaging that needs no extra wrapping. All three are made with the same ingredients and process we use in our cafes.</p><h3>When to Send a Cookie Gift Box</h3><ul><li>Client thank-yous and corporate gifting (works for any industry)</li><li>Employee recognition and remote team appreciation</li><li>Birthday, anniversary, and celebration gifts</li><li>Get-well and thinking-of-you sends</li><li>Holiday gifting for people who already have everything</li></ul><p>For individual-sized gifts, our <a href=\"/collections/pastry-pouch\">pastry pouches</a> are a one-cookie send built for the same occasions. For a broader selection, our full <a href=\"/collections/cookie-gifts\">cookie gifts collection</a> includes boxes, pouches, and individual cookie flavors.</p>"
          }
        }
